+      o2U sh2 sh3 m1 m2 m3 kfEq swU hs hiU hhi t acc =
+    scanAWV hU ix G R rc rok kb keyU s o key bw aw pmo o2 n1 a2 n2 base bit Gn Go oU Tu tM fsh bsh ash fM pmoU bwU awU
